    "###  Wrapper for training and testing\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Assumptions:   \n",
    "- Early stopping is default, add other callbacks as needed\n",
    "- `X_train,y_train,X_val,y_val,X_test,y_test` already defined, accessed here as global variables"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "1b2762a9-054d-4b73-bbd7-4d409560ac47",
   "metadata": {
